# Day 1 Setup: Build a My-Uniswap-V2 Foundry Project & Understand the Factory/Pair Architecture

Today we begin development of My-Uniswap-V2. Understanding the Uniswap V2 architecture is the foundation for writing and auditing advanced DeFi protocols.

Today's tasks are split into two parts:

1. Set up the development environment
2. Build a low-level intuition for the core architecture

