## Step 1: Initialize the Foundry Project

Open a terminal and run the following commands to initialize a clean project:

```bash
forge init My-Uniswap-V2
cd My-Uniswap-V2
```

Once inside the project, delete the auto-generated `src/Counter.sol`, `test/Counter.t.sol`, and `script/Counter.s.sol`. We are building everything from scratch to keep the workspace clean.

